==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|de|Prozent}}, ultimately from {{der|ru|la-new|[[per]] [[centum]]}}. First attested 1724.

Note natively formed {{m+|sh|постотак}}, {{m+|sl|odstotek}} (i.e. ''**отстоток''); {{m+|pl|odsetek}} (i.e. ''**отсоток'', see {{m|ru|пропо́рция}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|проце́нт}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-процент.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|ent|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|проце́нт|adj=проце́нтный}}

# [[percent]]
# [[percentage]] {{gloss|fraction or share}}
# {{lb|ru|finance|usually|in the plural}} [[interest]], [[rate]]; [[interest]] [[income]]
#: {{uxi|ru|получа́ть неплохи́е '''проце́нты'''|to earn a good '''income from the interest'''}}

